  "story": {
    "day": 56,
    "title": "Kaya's Busy Afternoon",
    "sentences": [
      "Kaya came home after her club.",
      "She often played badminton with her best friend.",
      "Sometimes, they tried volleyball or table tennis.",
      "Kaya was hungry for a delicious Japanese sandwich.",
      "Her grandfather, an office worker, called her telephone.",
      "\"Hey, Kaya! How was social studies?\" he asked.",
      "She talked about California and an American police officer.",
      "There was a funny firefighter in a video.",
      "He didn't fly, but Kaya sometimes wanted another job, like a vet.",
      "She could get to send him her regards.",
      "Kaya's friend liked art and music, not basketball or track and field.",
      "\"Uh-huh,\" she said. She had a lot of candy.",
      "She needed to take her trumpet, get on the bus, then get off."
    ]
  }
}